No smile.
No exaggerated expression.
Relaxed forehead.
Relaxed jaw.
Relaxed lips.

NEON HALO:

Create ONE continuous glowing orange-red neon light ring floating physically around the subject's head.

The ring is a three-dimensional elliptical halo, not a flat circle pasted onto the image.

It surrounds the head horizontally at approximately forehead / eye / upper-face level depending on perspective.

The ellipse must clearly travel through three-dimensional space:

the front section passes visually IN FRONT of part of the subject's face/head,

while the rear section passes BEHIND the head and hair.

Parts of the ring must therefore naturally disappear behind the head because of correct occlusion.

The ring should feel approximately 55–75 cm in diameter, significantly wider than the subject's head.

